ed as the difference of the market close price of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">$</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_9613dddb-c53a-4b6f-83e5-677db83af625" contextRef="C_1ec0d2a7-ef7d-47cc-9951-f8976c263b45" name="cue:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueOfOptionsMarketClosePrice" unitRef="U_UnitedStatesOfAmericaDollarsShare" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.31</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> on December 31, 2025, and the weighted average exercise price of </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">$</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_23ad6b64-85eb-4bc4-b04d-a0738d82815f" contextRef="C_56520009-a288-456f-ad3d-d57c0bbdc803" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableWeightedAverageExercisePrice" unitRef="U_UnitedStatesOfAmericaDollarsShare" scale="0" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5.91</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, with a weighted average remaining contractual term of </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_bccbb28f-3fc6-4c67-ab04-c126f4dbef44" contextRef="C_c27c4b6b-ced5-45f1-a0ec-6281c6e8c7dc" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTe